                        "elements": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "I wrote part of the queries. BQ uses partition and cluster but in RS the closest thing I think are sort key and distribution keys. I do not know much about them translate also this part in the future.\n\nThe RS ML part I entirely skipped since I am not interested in ML inside DWHs."
