                        "type": "rich_text_section",
                        "elements": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "Hi all, I just came across the de zoom camp and decided to join in. I also want to use aws instead of gcp. Do you know if the free tier will be enough to cover all the things covered in the course, or do I have do put some money in to get everything running."
