    {
        "user": "U04K5Q7V326",
        "type": "message",
        "ts": "1675948918.993679",
        "client_msg_id": "2be65f0f-8c47-450b-bcdc-b1a3e976e8e2",
        "text": "You can do this with free tier or at least under a very tight budget. Redshift is free for 2 months I think, you can create small EC2s for free. As of now, my average daily cost has been around 20 cents. Use Lambdas to maybe do the compute, which has a generous free compute.",
